WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:01.900
Meet PowerPoint2Vid.

00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:07.898
Drop in a slide deck, and get back a narrated, animated explainer video, made right in your browser.

00:00:09.598 --> 00:00:11.156
You already wrote the story.

00:00:11.156 --> 00:00:13.770
It lives in your slides and your speaker notes.

00:00:13.770 --> 00:00:16.107
But recording a video by hand takes hours.

00:00:16.107 --> 00:00:17.330
There is a faster way.

00:00:19.030 --> 00:00:19.805
Add your deck.

00:00:19.805 --> 00:00:20.690
Pick a narrator.

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:24.342
Choose a video style, from minimal cinematic to this keynote look.

00:00:24.342 --> 00:00:25.006
Then export.

00:00:25.006 --> 00:00:27.053
Your speaker notes become the script.

00:00:28.753 --> 00:00:30.668
Everything runs in your browser.

00:00:30.668 --> 00:00:34.259
Nothing is uploaded, so your slides never leave your device.

00:00:34.259 --> 00:00:36.474
There is no sign-up and no watermark.

00:00:38.174 --> 00:00:39.594
Try it with your own deck.

00:00:39.594 --> 00:00:43.526
Head to powerpoint2vid.com and turn your slides into a video in minutes.

